--- !u!114 &909171316
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 909171315}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Vera Dusk
    text: You say it so flat. Like stock. That was a market. Those were people. That
      was my sister. And you walked through it counting.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 15f752dc99d3fa049bc7d6dd112f7ae7, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: I felt nothing. I know how that sounds. They built me so this would feel
      like nothing.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ab97e54f3075b1a48a060d5432e43521, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: There's no monster here to find, Vera. Just a hand that did what it was
      told and never asked.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f9d0b93e0890f524ba3fbf47e78f576a, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1101490735}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1294233843}
  audioSource: {fileID: 909171317}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
