--- !u!114 &1332134537
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1332134536}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Echo
    text: Here. This is the second you've been carrying without knowing the shape
      of it. Watch his hand. Forget the blade. The hand.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 412778e42427def4c82325ac8b9b0bd4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: There. That's late. Something in me moved for the first time, and it moved
      a half second after it could have mattered. One breath too slow to save her.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f08788b43264ab345be1bd1da3273a96, type: 3}
  - speaker: Vera Dusk
    text: You hesitated.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7ed15b13bf388fd448009182b7b02e9b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: For the first time in my life. And it didn't save her. I've spared people
      since because of what started in this square.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4db14332d001619468c9882b13edfe7f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: I logged this as a fault for years, Cipher. It was the first true thing
      you ever did. And it was too late to matter. I can't make that into one thing.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2441b8d6ccf714745a2206802994bede, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1235789034}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1123368197}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1332134538}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
