--- !u!114 &1797005420
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1797005419}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: What I have is the sword. It remembers what I can't. It says I was there.
      It says I was late. And late doesn't help her. Or you.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 549c3a4c20714d44a922add084fded70, type: 3}
  - speaker: Vera Dusk
    text: Late. You stood in my square with that sword and you were late. What does
      a thing like you even mean by late.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a5beed03d0a92c49b3fa6b0f1383636, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: She wants to and she can't. Give her the truth. It's all you've got that's
      worth anything to her.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80c7c24562dd8454883e618b380e98f1, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: I can tell you what late meant. No one sees inside this but me and the
      blade. I'll walk it again and say every second out loud as I see it. If you
      want that, I won't make you.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3804dbfc16902de4fafb72c0e0bb1ff5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Vera Dusk
    text: Tell me, then. I've spent ten years not knowing how she went. Whatever
      it is, it can't be worse than the version I built in the dark.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a40d8b3f30343b04cb9e0d4b6bfed729, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 2137739005}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1639542984}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1797005421}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
